  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We know that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>. . .</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>....</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mn>15</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>...</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>...</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mn>15</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn></math></p>"
